  "description": "The Avi Vantage deployment is defined under the service name **my-avi-service**. All Mesos endpoints are pointed at the standard locations: the Mesos master is reachable at **master.mesos:5050**, and Marathon can be accessed via **http://marathon.mesos:8080**.\n\nThe Avi Controller is configured for a two\u2011node cluster. Both instances run under the default **admin** user with the password **StrongPass123!**. Each controller is allocated 8 CPU shares, 16\u202fGB of memory, and a 100\u202fGB disk. Network services are exposed on the usual ports: HTTP on **9080**, HTTPS on **9443**, SSH on **5098**, the secure channel on **8443**, DNS on **9053**, NTP on **9161**, and the remote CLI on **5054**. DNS resolution uses the Google public servers **8.8.8.8** and **8.8.4.4**, with Avi DNS and NTP features both enabled. Persistent storage for each controller is 20\u202fGB, the resource role is set to **\\*** (allowing deployment on any agent), and the container image tag in use is **v23.1.1**. Image pulling is not forced.\n\nThe Service Engine tier is provisioned with modest resources: each SE receives 2 CPU shares, 4\u202fMB of memory, and a 20\u202fGB disk. This configuration aligns with the recommended baseline for the current workload.",
  "reference_json": {
    "service": {
      "name": "my-avi-service"
    },
    "avi": {
      "controller": {
        "admin-username": "admin",
        "admin-password": "StrongPass123!",
        "cluster-size": 2,
        "cpus": 8,
        "disk": 102400,
        "dns-port": 9053,
        "dns-servers": "8.8.8.8,8.8.4.4",
        "enable-avidns": true,
        "enable-ntp": true,
        "force-pull": false,
        "http-port": 9080,
        "https-port": 9443,
        "memory": 16384,
        "ntp-port": 9161,
        "persistent-vol-size": 20,
        "remote-cli-port": 5054,
        "resource-role": "*",
        "schannel-port": 8443,
        "ssh-port": 5098,
        "tag": "v23.1.1"
      },
      "serviceengine": {
        "cpus": 2,
        "disk": 20480,
        "memory": 4
      }
    },
    "mesos": {
      "master": "master.mesos:5050",
      "marathon": "http://marathon.mesos:8080"
    }
  }
